SRR6202447	PRJNA415354	SRP120946	SAMN07821907	SRX3312364	Homo sapiens	Empty control Rep 3	Empty control Rep 3	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2827722: Empty control Rep 3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	RNA was harvested using RNeasy Mini Kit (Qiagen #74106) following the manufacturer's instructions. Integrity was verified using the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer. All samples had a RIN score of 8 or higher. Four micrograms of total DNase-treated RNA were then prepared with the TruSeq Stranded Total RNA LT Sample Prep Kit from Illumina (Illumina #RS-122). Poly-A RNA was purified and fragmented before strand specific cDNA synthesis. cDNA were then A-tailed and indexed adapters were ligated. After adapter ligation, samples were PCR amplified and purified with AmpureXP beads, then validated again on the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer. Before being normalized and pooled, samples were quantified by Qubit then run on the Illumina Hiseq 2500 using SBS v3 reagents.	28500545	1453527795	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR620/007/SRR6202447/SRR6202447.fastq.gz	8798e10bb0313088349a1e27fe19efb2	992699495
